    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Create your Steel Defender (from the module's Summoned Creatures compendium) after a Long Rest; a new one replaces the old (module). AC 12 + INT, HP 5 + 5 x Artificer level, Force-Empowered Rend with your spell attack (1d8 + 2 + INT Force), Repair (3/day, 2d8 + INT), Steel Bond (+PB to its checks and saves). Deflect Attack: when a creature within 5 ft of the defender attacks someone else, the module offers the defender's Reaction to give that attack Disadvantage. Restoring it with a spell slot is by hand.</p>",
